  "scope": "Atomic comparison startup passes 681 tests in 67 files, types/build, all 215 native desktop checks with normal close and two newly executed corrupt-file startup cases. Same 84 MB/297-thread benchmark reduces four-model startup writes from five to one and initial full-state notices from four to one, preserving the complete previous file, original owner/draft and all exact contexts/attachments. Source two-model first visibility is measured at 1,199 ms under the unchanged 30-second condition; four-model independent failure/stop/completion and eleven real requests pass under existing deadlines. Three current complete-suite captures are individually reviewed. Exact renderer/project assets retain the previous diff-view disposal body while the main-process body changes. Fresh matching distribution, hosted acceptance and the full remaining capability/UI scope remain pending."
